{
  "bookId": "hero-211011",
  "id": "bond-26004",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "26004001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "谢谢，我不擅长打扫卫生。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "26004003",
              "text": "不客气。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "26004003",
              "text": "上次的问题，想到答案了吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "26004002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26004003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "26004005",
              "text": "哈哈抱歉，冷场了呢。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "26004004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26004005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "那个问题，我认真想过了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26004006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26004007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "对作为手办的我而言，|101|是世界上最重要的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26004008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "|101|是「救世主」，内心有种永不枯竭的力量，关心大家每一个人，也在帮助成为手办的我们适应和成长。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "26004010",
              "text": "哪有你说的那么伟大……"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "26004010",
              "text": "这又是从哪看来的话？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "26004009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26004010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "《经典人物原型45种》，我每一页都仔细读过了，\n|101|就是「救世主」，每一条都很相符。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26004011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "真是……看来在理解人类方面，蒂娅还有很长的路要走呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26004012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "错了吗，我不明白。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26004013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "和我比起来，蒂娅才更像是「救世主」呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26004014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "真、真的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26004015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "当然，很厉害又很帅气！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26004016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "蒂娅可是真正的「先驱者」呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26004017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "那么，我们就是并肩作战的关系了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
